// Flyke worker protocol, v1.
//
// Every worker (Python today, Go/Rust later) that implements this service
// contract can execute Flyke workloads. Design rules:
//
//   * Worker-initiated, outbound only. The control plane never dials a worker.
//   * Unary RPCs only (long-poll for work). This keeps the protocol usable over
//     plain HTTP/1.1 + JSON via the Connect protocol, so a worker needs no gRPC
//     stack: POST /flyke.worker.v1.WorkerService/<Method> with a JSON body.
//   * Leases, not trust. Every assignment carries a lease id that is renewed by
